{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X少数感受句的比喻稍长，像S07的气味、触感、幻想与快感混合，不如Y某些短词能瞬间抓到身体感觉。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"边听音乐边扫屏幕时，X放大加亮的关键词能让我先抓住每段人物的变化，较短的感受句和到时才出现的提示也不会同时抢注意力；Y虽然每个短词容易认出，但右边同时堆得太多，反而不知道该看哪一个。X把他为什么靠近、为什么收住、为什么害怕、后来又为什么不再藏喜欢交代得更容易跟上，反复出现又逐渐变化的水波、小船和声音意象也让整首曲子像同一段经历。X的感受通常能对应具体的心理转折和音乐瞬间，甜里带酸、想说又停、放松后孤单等层次，比Y大量并列的情绪碎片更容易真正感受到。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9781e22e-f934-42a4-9a79-55a87aec4113", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T031156920378Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.782, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:12:36.706375+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4b6e7d2c653372dea0a2cdf432600b128f70f7a9f39ef49c81ebd28a6a66cb8b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42